# Farewell Richard!

Last night was Richard's last class with us as he set to travel around OZ with his lovely wife Sharon. Richard has been drumming with us from day one when we started our classes in Woodford and he will be sadly missed. It has been such a pleasure having you with us Richard and we wish you safe and happy travels. Richard and his wife Sharon have been such a consistent support for us, Richard is constantly helping us cart drums around and has performed at every event we have ever had! Including one occasion where we had to rove down the street in the hot sun with hundreds of spectators! Sharon is always given chores whether its babysitting, table watching or event photographer! Most importantly Richard has been dancing with us now for at least a year...and despite a class full of girls, he has stayed strong! He has promised us that he will return and will post us regular updates in the meantime.. so we will hold him to that :) All our blessings for your travels, Nat, Bec, Elijah and Emiel
